---
config:
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  securityLevel: strict
  fontFamily: 'Noto Sans CJK SC, sans-serif'
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: 'Noto Sans CJK SC, sans-serif'
    fontSize: 17px
    background: '#ffffff'
    primaryColor: '#EAF3F5'
    primaryTextColor: '#173B47'
    primaryBorderColor: '#6794A0'
    lineColor: '#64828C'
    edgeLabelBackground: '#ffffff'
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    wrappingWidth: 240
    curve: linear
    nodeSpacing: 30
    rankSpacing: 42
    padding: 16
    useMaxWidth: false
---
%% Omnidraw -> local mermaid sub-skill. Office manifest orchestration, not SVG processing.
flowchart TD
    A["创建 / 编辑需求<br/>office-planner 验收简报"] --> B["正文 / 文风（按需）<br/>office-writer"]
    A --> C["配图制作（按需）<br/>office-visuals · Omnidraw"]
    A --> D["表格规格（按需）<br/>Omnisheet"]
    B --> E["原生办公文件制作<br/>office-docx · office-xlsx<br/>office-pptx · office-pdf"]
    C --> E
    D --> E
    A -->|仅格式制作| E
    E --> F["结构 · 内容 · 数值<br/>原生功能与约束校验"]
    F --> G["全量页面 / 交付视图<br/>实际渲染与视觉审阅"]
    G --> H{"独立 office-qa<br/>当前版本通过？"}
    H -->|是| I["可编辑成品 + 证据<br/>正式交付"]
    H -->|否：制作人修复并复验| E
    classDef input fill:#EDF4F7,stroke:#6E97A6,color:#173B47;
    classDef maker fill:#E8F3EE,stroke:#64957D,color:#173E2C;
    classDef gate fill:#FBF3DE,stroke:#B29A59,color:#52421D;
    classDef done fill:#DCEEE4,stroke:#4C8467,color:#143E29;
    class A,B,C,D input;
    class E maker;
    class F,G,H gate;
    class I done;
